Z||000002||2M4 Dale||03-17-2000||11:35 PM||||The black clearcoat is just black of course. The Prismacoat stuff is like a fine metalic that seems to change colors with the angle you look at it or differences in light. Might be able to post some samples tommorow but by then the job will be underway. I think I'm gonna go with the Prismacoat.  Something different.||||reg||6
