Z||000005||batboy||03-19-2000||06:49 AM||||I'm paint illiterate, but that prismacoat sounds really nice. What's the catch? There must be a downside. Good luck, I wanna see a pic.||||reg||1
Z||000006||2M4 Dale||03-19-2000||09:15 AM||||No difference in price. And I'm not sure if there is a down side . It's just an layer of clear with metalic in it. Over the black basecoat and under the final clearcoat. Should be COOL. I just hope it ain't HOKEY lookin'. It deffinatly will be different. I'll post some pics.<P>Tabasco just got his car done in red Prismatic. I'll see if he wants to post some pics.||||reg||1
Z||000007||Monkeyman||03-19-2000||10:01 AM||||Not sure exactly what Prismatic is, but the Grape Ape is done in a pearlized paint.  It actually changes colors depending on the viewing angle.  If it wasn't raining today, I'd take some good pics and post them.  ||||reg||1
